@Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:51020

### Startup probe
GET {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/health/startup
Accept: application/json

### Readiness probe
GET {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/health/readiness
Accept: application/json

### Liveness probe
GET {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/health/liveness
Accept: application/json

### Scenario (ARV-027). Set @key to an operator key whose SHA-256 is in Simulation:Control:Keys; never commit a key.
@key = {{$dotenv SIMULATION_KEY}}

### The simulated day
GET {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulation/scenario
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Every queue at 18:05 (minute 1085)
GET {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulation/scenario/queues?minute=1085
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Arrivals Visitors at 18:25, degraded while S-17 is offline
GET {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulation/scenario/queues/A-VIS?minute=1105
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Sensors at 18:25
GET {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulation/scenario/sensors?minute=1105
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Alerts of the day
GET {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulation/scenario/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Re-run with another seed (control scope)
PUT {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulation/scenario
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "seed": 9303 }

### ARV-139b: the scenario sites (DMO and AUH-TA)
GET {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulation/scenario/sites
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### AUH-TA: arrivals Visitors at 18:12 (minute 1092), when its nowcast passes 15 minutes
GET {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulation/scenario/queues/A-VIS?minute=1092&site=AUH-TA
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### AUH-TA: the smart gates at 19:18 (minute 1158), spilling into A-EG-OV
GET {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulation/scenario/queues/A-EG?minute=1158&site=AUH-TA
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### AUH-TA: alerts of the day
GET {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulation/scenario/alerts?site=AUH-TA
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### AUH-TA: re-run with its default seed (control scope)
PUT {{Ariva.Simulation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/simulation/scenario
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "seed": 9304, "site": "AUH-TA" }
